%% Coordinates that `Number()` reads as NaN: the reference drops `cx` (or `cy`) and writes
%% `translate(undefined, …)` (or `NaN`) for the label. The other points are drawn.
quadrantChart
  title Coordinates that are not numbers
  x-axis Low --> High
  y-axis Low --> High
  quadrant-1 A
  quadrant-2 B
  quadrant-3 C
  quadrant-4 D
  Comma x: [0,5, 0.5]
  Letter y: [0.5, 0a5]
  Minus x: [0-5, 0.25]
  Space y: [0.5, 0 5]
  Normal: [0.5, 0.5]
